      "header": "#8-Hard",
      "difficulty": "Hard",
      "prompt_html": "<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\text{在} [0,+\\infty) \\text{上，} \\ t^{m} * t^{n} = (\\quad), \\text{其中} m,n \\text{为正整数.}\">\\text{在} [0,+\\infty) \\text{上，} \\ t^{m} * t^{n} = (\\quad), \\text{其中} m,n \\text{为正整数.}</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\frac { m ! n ! } { ( m + n + 1 ) ! } t ^ { m + n + 1 }\">\\frac { m ! n ! } { ( m + n + 1 ) ! } t ^ { m + n + 1 }</span>"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\frac { m ! n ! } { ( m + n ) ! } t ^ { m + n + 1 }\">\\frac { m ! n ! } { ( m + n ) ! } t ^ { m + n + 1 }</span>"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\frac { m ! n ! } { ( m + n ) ! } t ^ { m + n }\">\\frac { m ! n ! } { ( m + n ) ! } t ^ { m + n }</span>"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\frac { m ! n ! } { ( m + n + 1 ) ! } t ^ { m + n }\">\\frac { m ! n ! } { ( m + n + 1 ) ! } t ^ { m + n }</span>"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} t^m\\ast t^n&amp;=\\int_0^t \\tau^m\\bigl(t-\\tau\\bigr)^nd\\tau=\\int_0^t \\tau^m\\sum_{k=0}^n\\bigl(-1\\bigr)^k\\binom{n}{k}t^{n-k}\\tau^kd\\tau\\\\ &amp;=\\sum_{k=0}^n\\bigl(-1\\bigr)^k\\binom{n}{k}t^{n-k}\\int_0^t \\tau^{m+k}d\\tau=\\sum_{k=0}^n\\bigl(-1\\bigr)^k\\binom{n}{k}t^{n-k}\\,\\frac{t^{m+k+1}}{m+k+1}\\\\ &amp;\\sum_{k=0}^n\\bigl(-1\\bigr)^k\\binom{n}{k}\\frac{t^{m+n+1}}{m+k+1}=t^{m+n}\\sum_{k=0}^n\\bigl(-1\\bigr)^k\\,\\frac{1}{\\bigl(m+1\\bigr)+k}\\binom{n}{k}\\\\ &amp;=t^{m+n+1}\\frac{n!}{\\bigl(m+1\\bigr)\\bigl(m+2\\bigr)\\cdots\\bigl(m+1+n\\bigr)}=\\frac{m!\\,n!}{\\bigl(m+n+1\\bigr)!}t^{m+n+1}\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} t^m\\ast t^n&amp;=\\int_0^t \\tau^m\\bigl(t-\\tau\\bigr)^nd\\tau=\\int_0^t \\tau^m\\sum_{k=0}^n\\bigl(-1\\bigr)^k\\binom{n}{k}t^{n-k}\\tau^kd\\tau\\\\ &amp;=\\sum_{k=0}^n\\bigl(-1\\bigr)^k\\binom{n}{k}t^{n-k}\\int_0^t \\tau^{m+k}d\\tau=\\sum_{k=0}^n\\bigl(-1\\bigr)^k\\binom{n}{k}t^{n-k}\\,\\frac{t^{m+k+1}}{m+k+1}\\\\ &amp;\\sum_{k=0}^n\\bigl(-1\\bigr)^k\\binom{n}{k}\\frac{t^{m+n+1}}{m+k+1}=t^{m+n}\\sum_{k=0}^n\\bigl(-1\\bigr)^k\\,\\frac{1}{\\bigl(m+1\\bigr)+k}\\binom{n}{k}\\\\ &amp;=t^{m+n+1}\\frac{n!}{\\bigl(m+1\\bigr)\\bigl(m+2\\bigr)\\cdots\\bigl(m+1+n\\bigr)}=\\frac{m!\\,n!}{\\bigl(m+n+1\\bigr)!}t^{m+n+1}\\end{aligned}</div>"
